inspect the project configuration

Usage:
  berth config [flags]
  berth config [command]

Available Commands:
  validate    parse and validate berth.toml
  show        print the resolved configuration as JSON
  schema      print the JSON Schema of berth.toml

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for config

Global Flags:
      --config string   path to berth.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
  -V, --version         output the version number

Use "berth config [command] --help" for more information about a command.
